    "Valor": "Value",
    "Tamizajes realizados en 12 meses": "Screenings completed in 12 months",
    "Sin hallazgos derivables (78%)": "No referable findings (78%)",
    "Horas de especialista liberadas (20 min por consulta)": "Specialist hours freed up (20 min per appointment)",
    "Equivalente en jornadas completas de consultorio": "Equivalent full clinic days",
    "Casos derivados con prioridad por riesgo (18%)": "Cases prioritized for risk-based referral (18%)",
